{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/e25bdbdbb4b5a7d55483a79901dfab85.avif?t=1772042104\" width=780 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/853c55eeeb4b40e6335a150787f2e6dd.poster.avif?t=1772042104\" width=1170 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/853c55eeeb4b40e6335a150787f2e6dd.webm?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/853c55eeeb4b40e6335a150787f2e6dd.mp4?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Load up your gun, Toxic Commando, and team up in a 4-player squad to send the Sludge God and its undead horde back to hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/3be8309cff955dc9d4eebb088979e99e.avif?t=1772042104\" width=673 height=109 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d00df066b1ff069b51b8281d584da03a.poster.avif?t=1772042104\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d00df066b1ff069b51b8281d584da03a.webm?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d00df066b1ff069b51b8281d584da03a.mp4?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather a 4-player squad or jump in with fellow commandos online for pure co-op chaos. Revive fallen teammates, share ammo, cover each other's backs, and laugh through the madness. When infected swarm from every angle, teamwork isn't optional\u2014it's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/395283e1db2d131414d38c6c372b858f.avif?t=1772042104\" width=695 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d6edf9689194704bccacedcd8b45dc99.poster.avif?t=1772042104\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d6edf9689194704bccacedcd8b45dc99.webm?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d6edf9689194704bccacedcd8b45dc99.mp4?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash hell with an arsenal of guns, grenades, and devastating powers as thousands of infected pour toward you in relentless waves. Powered by Saber's Swarm Engine (World War Z, Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2), the horde never stops\u2014and neither should your trigger finger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/aa745429448d399c12e5071445b8c340.avif?t=1772042104\" width=697 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/2d1b9810c584b9820ed554e37fffb054.poster.avif?t=1772042104\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/2d1b9810c584b9820ed554e37fffb054.webm?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/2d1b9810c584b9820ed554e37fffb054.mp4?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Search for vehicles scattered across semi-open maps and tear through the wasteland. Each ride feels unique: some pack serious firepower or special abilities; others come with handy tools like winches. Find what fits your squad, then floor it through the hordes for that pure rush of power and satisfaction\u2014nothing beats turning zombies into roadkill.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2157830?t=1772042104","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/2af7ad638ddaec50b9aff6f7328bf082546c2a81/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772042104","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/bf3eaf0bbffc82a7e40d6e2c3efdd8a663ac471e/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772042104","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/bf3eaf0bbffc82a7e40d6e2c3efdd8a663ac471e/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772042104","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4354730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/3aabf6fce59453706b538a473e112938.avif?t=1772042104\" width=780 height=445 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the most stylish member of your crew with the Leon\u2019s Secret Stash DLC! Unlock two devastating weapons: the powerful ACW-20 assault rifle and the Wakizashi, a traditional Japanese katana. An avatar and a special title also included.</p></p><br><h1>BLOOD EDITION</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/03d951e76441501962b6403145de8643.avif?t=1772042104\" width=780 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bloody Pass includes the Cosmetic Pack: Bloody Pass and the first two DLCs released after John Carpenter's Toxic Commando launches. These DLCs feature 30 skins to personalize your favorite characters, vehicles, and weapons\u2014from weapon colors and character outfits to vehicle skins, and honk sounds.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/e25bdbdbb4b5a7d55483a79901dfab85.avif?t=1772042104\" width=780 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/853c55eeeb4b40e6335a150787f2e6dd.poster.avif?t=1772042104\" width=1170 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/853c55eeeb4b40e6335a150787f2e6dd.webm?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/853c55eeeb4b40e6335a150787f2e6dd.mp4?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Load up your gun, Toxic Commando, and team up in a 4-player squad to send the Sludge God and its undead horde back to hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/3be8309cff955dc9d4eebb088979e99e.avif?t=1772042104\" width=673 height=109 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d00df066b1ff069b51b8281d584da03a.poster.avif?t=1772042104\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d00df066b1ff069b51b8281d584da03a.webm?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d00df066b1ff069b51b8281d584da03a.mp4?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gather a 4-player squad or jump in with fellow commandos online for pure co-op chaos. Revive fallen teammates, share ammo, cover each other's backs, and laugh through the madness. When infected swarm from every angle, teamwork isn't optional\u2014it's survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/395283e1db2d131414d38c6c372b858f.avif?t=1772042104\" width=695 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d6edf9689194704bccacedcd8b45dc99.poster.avif?t=1772042104\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d6edf9689194704bccacedcd8b45dc99.webm?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/d6edf9689194704bccacedcd8b45dc99.mp4?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash hell with an arsenal of guns, grenades, and devastating powers as thousands of infected pour toward you in relentless waves. Powered by Saber's Swarm Engine (World War Z, Warhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2), the horde never stops\u2014and neither should your trigger finger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/aa745429448d399c12e5071445b8c340.avif?t=1772042104\" width=697 height=109 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/2d1b9810c584b9820ed554e37fffb054.poster.avif?t=1772042104\" width=1170 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/2d1b9810c584b9820ed554e37fffb054.webm?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/extras/2d1b9810c584b9820ed554e37fffb054.mp4?t=1772042104\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Search for vehicles scattered across semi-open maps and tear through the wasteland. Each ride feels unique: some pack serious firepower or special abilities; others come with handy tools like winches. Find what fits your squad, then floor it through the hordes for that pure rush of power and satisfaction\u2014nothing beats turning zombies into roadkill.</p>","developers":["Saber Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157830/4846bf6bba3648363742f88d86d680d767f628e2/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772042104","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92026 John Carpenter\u2019s Toxic Commando, a game developed by Saber Interactive and published by Focus Entertainment. Focus Entertainment, Saber Interactive and their respective logos are trademarks or registered trademarks. All other trademarks, registered trademarks or their logos belong to their respective owners. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2157830/732900470/787f6767d0fdc28b003326af612328b291e47159/1772039886/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772042103","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2157830/732900470/787f6767d0fdc28b003326af612328b291e47159/1772039886